// error: `Instant` has no field `year`
// error: `Duration` has no field `atZone`
// error: `Duration` has no field `epochSeconds`
// error: `-` needs Instant to implement `Neg`
// error: expected Duration, found Instant
// An instant has no calendar until a zone is named, a monotonic reading has no zone at all, a
// duration is no instant, and instants neither negate nor add.
import avin.time.{Duration, monotonic, now}

main()
    println(now().year())
    println(monotonic().atZone(0))
    println(Duration.Zero.epochSeconds())
    println(-now())
    println(now() + now())
